<p>Ervin was killed in action on April 2, 1945 one day after they landed on Okinawa. He is buried beside his parents in Union Cemetery, Mandan.His widow later remarried. Both Leona and his son Steven currently live in California.The Society would like to thank MHSoc lifetime member Libuse [Rybnicek] Imbrone for sharing this information on her brother with us. All images used with permission.</p>
